CharacterName,Juggernaut,主宰
CharacterName,Morphling,變體精靈
ClassDescription,"A fluid DOTA2 hero who commands surging waves, shifts freely between Strength and Agility, empowers himself through Ebb & Flow, and morphs into foes.",來自 DOTA2 的水元素英雄：能化作波浪突進、自由轉換力量與敏捷、憑先天技能「潮漲潮落」隨屬性動態強化移速/射程/施法距離/減速抗性，並可變形為敵人形態。
ClassDescription,"A masked DOTA2 blademaster who builds unstoppable momentum through Bladeform, carves through magic with Blade Fury, sustains allies with Healing Ward, and cuts down foes with Blade Dance and Omnislash.",來自 DOTA2 的面具劍客：憑先天技能「劍心猶在」積攢無傷勢能強化移速與敏捷、以「劍刃風暴」破法清場、以「治療守衛」續航，並以「劍舞」暴擊與「無敵斬」收割敵陣。
