EntityDescription,A floating restorative totem summoned by Juggernaut that heals nearby allies for a percentage of their maximum HP each turn.,主宰召喚的懸浮治療圖騰，每回合為周圍友方單位按最大生命值百分比回復生命。
EntityDescription,"A sentient elemental forged from living tidewater, capable of reshaping its physical attributes at will.",由活水潮汐凝聚而成的智慧元素，能隨心重塑自身的力量與敏捷形態。
EntityName,healing ward,治療守衛
EntityName,waterkin,變體水靈
ExplosionName,blade fury spin,
ItemDescription,A condensed sphere of living tidewater launched as infinite ranged ammunition from a sling.,由活水潮汐凝聚的遠程水彈，可作為彈弓無限彈藥發射。
ItemName,tidal orb,潮汐水彈
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] -12.5% 無敵斬藍耗: 藍耗 12 → 10,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] -20% 治療守衛藍耗: 藍耗 7 → 6,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] +15% 劍刃風暴移速:,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] +15% 劍舞暴擊倍率: 1.8× → 1.95×,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] +3 無敵斬斬擊次數: 最高 15 斬,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] +4 劍刃風暴基礎傷害: 受敏捷與劍心猶在攻速頻率縮放,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] +40% 劍舞暴擊吸血:,
PropertyDescription,[DOTA2 Talent] 劍心猶在疊層間隔減半: 4 回合 → 2 回合,
PropertyDescription,Innate (Bladeform): Gain 1 stack every 4 turns without taking damage (up to 10 stacks). Each stack grants +1% movement speed and +2.5% agility strike power and attack speed; lingers 4 turns after taking damage.,先天技能「劍心猶在」：每連續 4 回合未受傷害疊加 1 層（上限 10 層），每層提供 +1% 移速與 +2.5% 等效敏捷攻速及近戰/無敵斬額外傷害；受傷後保留 4 回合粘滯期。
PropertyDescription,Innate (Ebb & Flow): Agility grants bonus movement speed and ranged attack range; Strength grants bonus spell cast range and slow resistance. Persists while morphed.,先天技能「潮漲潮落」：敏捷提供額外移速與遠程攻擊距離；力量提供額外施法距離與減速抗性（變形期間持續保留）。
PropertyDescription,Leaping between nearby enemies in a blur of invulnerable strikes: immune to all damage and debuffs while slashing a nearby foe each turn.,
PropertyDescription,"Passive (Blade Dance): Melee attacks, Omnislash strikes, and Blade Fury spins have a 20% to 35% chance (by Medium Blade mastery) to critically strike for 1.8x damage.",被動技能「劍舞」：近戰普攻、無敵斬與劍刃風暴有 20% ~ 35% 概率（隨中刃熟練度提升）觸發 1.8 倍致命一擊。
PropertyDescription,"Spinning in a destructive storm of blades: immune to debuffs, 80% magical damage reduction, and dealing magical damage around you each turn.",劍刃風暴旋轉中：免疫負面狀態、獲得 80% 魔法/元素傷害減免，並每回合對周圍敵人造成魔法傷害。
PropertyName,blade dance,劍舞
